    # "You reach the kitchenette and press the button on the coffee machine to start heating up the water."
    "你走到茶水间，按下咖啡机上的按钮，开始烧水。"

# game/Days/dayNine.rpy:4334
translate chinese d9_no_daphne_path_checkpoint_377e815d:

    # mel "..."
    mel "……"

# game/Days/dayNine.rpy:4335
translate chinese d9_no_daphne_path_checkpoint_211b0fa9:

    # mel "Well, there goes my peaceful morning."
    mel "好吧，我安稳的早晨算是泡汤了。"

# game/Days/dayNine.rpy:4338
translate chinese d9_no_daphne_path_checkpoint_febdf4f8:

    # mc "G'morning to you too."
    mc "早啊，你也是。"

# game/Days/dayNine.rpy:4340
translate chinese d9_no_daphne_path_checkpoint_589c80b1:

    # mel "Is it?"
    mel "是吗？"

# game/Days/dayNine.rpy:4342
translate chinese d9_no_daphne_path_checkpoint_a46f7938:

    # mc "Rough day already?"
    mc "今天已经这么糟了？"

# game/Days/dayNine.rpy:4344
translate chinese d9_no_daphne_path_checkpoint_59281ce0:

    # mel "It is now."
    mel "现在就是了。"

# game/Days/dayNine.rpy:4345
translate chinese d9_no_daphne_path_checkpoint_cb8ea7d7:

    # mcT "Charming as ever."
    mcT "还是一如既往地迷人。"

# game/Days/dayNine.rpy:4353
translate chinese d9_no_daphne_path_checkpoint_6246d972:

    # mc "I just came in for a hot drink. I won't be long."
    mc "我进来就为喝杯热的。不会耽误太久。"

# game/Days/dayNine.rpy:4373
translate chinese d9_coffeeMaking_71c8e1ae:

    # mcT "Hm, for some reason I have an odd appreciation for the vibrancy of color..."
    mcT "嗯，不知怎么的，我对色彩的鲜活有种奇怪的好感……"

# game/Days/dayNine.rpy:4379
translate chinese d9_coffeeMaking_32ad4d4a:

    # mcT "How weird..."
    mcT "真奇怪……"

# game/Days/dayNine.rpy:4389
translate chinese d9_coffeeMaking_99d9f423:

    # mc "Want me to make you one while I'm at it?"
    mc "要不要我顺手也给你来一杯？"

# game/Days/dayNine.rpy:4394
translate chinese d9_coffeeMaking_99d9f423_1:

    # mc "Want me to make you one while I'm at it?"
    mc "要不要我顺手也给你来一杯？"

# game/Days/dayNine.rpy:4405
translate chinese d9_coffeeMaking_2b35b6fe:

    # mc "..."
    mc "……"

# game/Days/dayNine.rpy:4408
translate chinese d9_coffeeMaking_5b013c06:

    # mc "Shit. I guess I did something wrong again..."
    mc "靠。我好像又搞砸了……"

# game/Days/dayNine.rpy:4418
translate chinese d9_coffeeMaking_05c966cb:

    # mcAlt "You think?"
    mcAlt "你说呢？"

# game/Days/dayNine.rpy:4421
translate chinese d9_coffeeMaking_3b720c93:

    # mc "Wha... What's happening? Why did everything suddenly turn grey??"
    mc "什……怎么了？为什么所有东西突然都变灰了？？"

# game/Days/dayNine.rpy:4422
translate chinese d9_coffeeMaking_7b793d36:

    # mc "I... I can't move..."
    mc "我……我动不了……"

# game/Days/dayNine.rpy:4432
translate chinese d9_coffeeMaking_75c6c293:

    # mcAlt "Why the fuck do you think it's gone grey?"
    mcAlt "你觉得它他妈为什么会变灰？"

# game/Days/dayNine.rpy:4433
translate chinese d9_coffeeMaking_95c7de6d:

    # mcAlt "And just because you've {i}really{/i} fucked it up this time, I'm keeping it this way."
    mcAlt "就因为你这次{i}真的{/i}搞砸了，所以我就让它一直这样。"

# game/Days/dayNine.rpy:4434
translate chinese d9_coffeeMaking_3110b450:

    # mcAlt "Luckily, me and mine make and enforce the rules."
    mcAlt "好在我和我的人既制定规则，也执行规则。"

# game/Days/dayNine.rpy:4436
translate chinese d9_coffeeMaking_158cb45f:

    # mc "What's going on??? I know I didn't take any drugs..."
    mc "到底怎么回事？？我明明没吸毒品……"

# game/Days/dayNine.rpy:4437
translate chinese d9_coffeeMaking_414f63c3:

    # mc "Who are you?"
    mc "你是谁？"

# game/Days/dayNine.rpy:4439
translate chinese d9_coffeeMaking_27c83f39:

    # mcAlt "I'm the better version of you. The one who actually sticks to the path."
    mcAlt "我是那个更好的你。是那个真正走在正道上的人。"

# game/Days/dayNine.rpy:4440
translate chinese d9_coffeeMaking_15bb04b3:

    # mcAlt "They call me the Timekeeper."
    mcAlt "他们叫我「时间守护者」。"

# game/Days/dayNine.rpy:4442
translate chinese d9_coffeeMaking_e550237f:

    # mcAlt "And right now, I'm calling you a blasphemous heathen."
    mcAlt "而现在，我判你一个亵渎神明的异端。"

# game/Days/dayNine.rpy:4443
translate chinese d9_coffeeMaking_a6e86e29:

    # mcAlt "I can forgive shitting after showering, but this? This is unforgivable."
    mcAlt "洗完澡再拉屎我可以原谅，但这个？这个绝对不能原谅。"

# game/Days/dayNine.rpy:4445
translate chinese d9_coffeeMaking_96db643a:

    # mc "I mean... Putting the milk first is how I've always done it?"
    mc "我的意思是……先放牛奶，我一直都是这么做的啊？"

# game/Days/dayNine.rpy:4448
translate chinese d9_coffeeMaking_2cd4d2f9:

    # mcAlt "Exactly. And that's the fucking problem!"
    mcAlt "没错。而问题他妈就在这儿！"

# game/Days/dayNine.rpy:4449
translate chinese d9_coffeeMaking_cf425206:

    # mcAlt "Who puts the milk in the mug before the water!?"
    mcAlt "谁会先把牛奶倒进杯子再倒水！？"

# game/Days/dayNine.rpy:4452
translate chinese d9_coffeeMaking_4c357714:

    # mc "Me-"
    mc "我——"

# game/Days/dayNine.rpy:4455
translate chinese d9_coffeeMaking_967f0f1c:

    # mcAlt "A fucking imbecile! That's who!"
    mcAlt "一个他妈的白痴！说的就是你！"

# game/Days/dayNine.rpy:4456
translate chinese d9_coffeeMaking_2d65016e:

    # mcAlt "Absolute fucking animal. I honestly don't know how you can sleep at night."
    mcAlt "彻头彻尾的畜生。我真不知道你晚上是怎么睡得着的。"

# game/Days/dayNine.rpy:4459
translate chinese d9_coffeeMaking_30b975b5:

    # mcAlt "We're so different it's painful."
    mcAlt "我们差得太远了，差得让人难受。"

# game/Days/dayNine.rpy:4462
translate chinese d9_coffeeMaking_cb9c28e5:

    # mcAlt "Three times. That's my limit. Even I get tired of shooting you."
    mcAlt "三次，这是我的极限。我连开枪打你都打腻了。"

# game/Days/dayNine.rpy:4464
translate chinese d9_coffeeMaking_050cf9f4:

    # mcAlt "There's only so much stupidity I can tolerate."
    mcAlt "愚蠢这种东西，我能忍的也就这么多了。"

# game/Days/dayNine.rpy:4465
translate chinese d9_coffeeMaking_1082637e:

    # mcAlt "Next time I'm passing the reigns to Timekeeper [suz]. Luckily she doesn't have a gun."
    mcAlt "下次我就把主导权交给时间守护者[suz]。好在她不用枪。"

# game/Days/dayNine.rpy:4467
translate chinese d9_coffeeMaking_c26a08b8:

    # mc "She... doesn't?"
    mc "她……没有枪？"

# game/Days/dayNine.rpy:4469
translate chinese d9_coffeeMaking_676f16ec:

    # mcAlt "Oh, it's much worse than that."
    mcAlt "哦，那可比没有枪糟糕多了。"

# game/Days/dayNine.rpy:4470
translate chinese d9_coffeeMaking_8aaed421:

    # mcAlt "I'm glad I get to reset the timeline for this. The universe can't let this stand."
    mcAlt "真好，我能把时间线重置一回。宇宙可不能容许这种事发生。"

# game/Days/dayNine.rpy:4471
translate chinese d9_coffeeMaking_bf3cbebc:

    # mcAlt "Stop{w} Being{w} A {w}Degenerate {w}Fuck up."
    mcAlt "别{w}再{w}当{w}什{w}么{w}堕{w}落{w}的{w}混{w}蛋。"

# game/Days/dayNine.rpy:4489
translate chinese d9_coffeeMaking_9332be4b:

    # mel "I'm perfectly capable of making my own coffee, thank you very much."
    mel "我自己完全会泡咖啡，非常感谢。"

# game/Days/dayNine.rpy:4492
translate chinese d9_coffeeMaking_53127db9:

    # mc "One of the best coffees you've ever had, coming right up, Mel."
    mc "你喝过最好的咖啡，马上就来，[mel]。"

# game/Days/dayNine.rpy:4493
translate chinese d9_coffeeMaking_4e5e8653:

    # "Her pen stops mid-stroke."
    "她的笔停在半途。"

# game/Days/dayNine.rpy:4495
translate chinese d9_coffeeMaking_127e3f02:

    # mel "Excuse me?"
    mel "你说什么？"

# game/Days/dayNine.rpy:4497
translate chinese d9_coffeeMaking_3f9df27f:

    # mc "...What?"
    mc "……什么？"

# game/Days/dayNine.rpy:4499
translate chinese d9_coffeeMaking_921f5041:

    # mel "Do not give me a pet name."
    mel "别给我起昵称。"

# game/Days/dayNine.rpy:4500
translate chinese d9_coffeeMaking_5d02b5a7:

    # mel "We are not friends. We are not familiar. You do not know me 'like that.'"
    mel "我们不是朋友，也不熟。你并不了解我「到那种地步」。"

# game/Days/dayNine.rpy:4508
translate chinese d9_coffeeMaking_45be909f:

    # "Your eyes flick down to her left hand. No ring."
    "你的目光落到她的左手上。没有戒指。"

# game/Days/dayNine.rpy:4509
translate chinese d9_coffeeMaking_eaecbe0f:

    # mc "Noted. Ms. [mel] it is then."
    mc "知道了。那就称呼[mel]女士吧。"

# game/Days/dayNine.rpy:4511
translate chinese d9_coffeeMaking_86444f31:

    # mel "That's not any better, either.{w} [mel] is more than adequate. I'm not here to entertain formalities with you as well."
    mel "那样也没好到哪去。{w}[mel]这样就够了。我也不是来跟你玩客套的。"

# game/Days/dayNine.rpy:4515
translate chinese d9_coffeeMaking_4596dcfc:

    # mcT "It's a good thing she's pretty..."
    mcT "还好她长得漂亮……"

# game/Days/dayNine.rpy:4518
translate chinese d9_coffeeMaking_991f9448:

    # mel "I said I didn't want-"
    mel "我说过我不想要——"

# game/Days/dayNine.rpy:4520
translate chinese d9_coffeeMaking_ae45b220:

    # mc "And I made it anyway."
    mc "但我还是做了。"

# game/Days/dayNine.rpy:4524
translate chinese d9_coffeeMaking_08af5e3b:

    # "You pull out the chair next to her and sit down."
    "你拉出她旁边的椅子，坐了下来。"

# game/Days/dayNine.rpy:4526
translate chinese d9_coffeeMaking_a950dff4:

    # mel "What do you think you're doing?"
    mel "你觉得你在干什么？"

# game/Days/dayNine.rpy:4529
translate chinese d9_coffeeMaking_5b33e4d4:

    # mc "Sitting down?"
    mc "坐下？"

# game/Days/dayNine.rpy:4531
translate chinese d9_coffeeMaking_d960ca3e:

    # mel "I can see that. Why are you sitting {i}here{/i}?"
    mel "我看得到。你为什么要坐{i}这儿{/i}？"

# game/Days/dayNine.rpy:4533
translate chinese d9_coffeeMaking_df30be8b:

    # mc "Because there's nowhere else to sit with a table."
    mc "因为这屋里就剩这一张桌子旁还有位子。"

# game/Days/dayNine.rpy:4536
translate chinese d9_coffeeMaking_0bb76a6c:

    # mel "There are six other tables in this room."
    mel "这屋里还有另外六张空桌。"

# game/Days/dayNine.rpy:4537
translate chinese d9_coffeeMaking_34898018:

    # mc "Yeah, but this is the one I chose."
    mc "是啊，但我选了这张。"

# game/Days/dayNine.rpy:4540
translate chinese d9_coffeeMaking_02f6adea:

    # mel "Are you trying to be clever, boy?"
    mel "你在跟我耍聪明吗，小子？"

# game/Days/dayNine.rpy:4544
translate chinese d9_coffeeMaking_e4badb16:

    # mc "No. Just trying to drink my tea and maybe understand why you hate me so much?"
    mc "不是。只是想喝杯茶，顺便搞清楚你这么讨厌我的原因。"

# game/Days/dayNine.rpy:4546
translate chinese d9_coffeeMaking_07177b0f:

    # mc "No. Just trying to drink my coffee and maybe understand why you hate me so much?"
    mc "不是。只是想喝杯咖啡，顺便搞清楚你这么讨厌我的原因。"

# game/Days/dayNine.rpy:4547
translate chinese d9_coffeeMaking_1f4f76e8:

    # mel "Do you think of me as a child?"
    mel "你把我当小孩看？"

# game/Days/dayNine.rpy:4548
translate chinese d9_coffeeMaking_2111abc4:

    # mel "I don't hate you."
    mel "我不讨厌你。"

# game/Days/dayNine.rpy:4549
translate chinese d9_coffeeMaking_3b4763ea:

    # mc "Could've fooled me."
    mc "我还真差点信了。"

# game/Days/dayNine.rpy:4552
translate chinese d9_coffeeMaking_a364b5c7:

    # mel "I simply don't trust you. There's a difference."
    mel "我只是不信任你。这不一样。"

# game/Days/dayNine.rpy:4554
translate chinese d9_coffeeMaking_164c3cad:

    # mc "Fair enough. So, what would it take?"
    mc "有道理。那要怎样才行？"

# game/Days/dayNine.rpy:4556
translate chinese d9_coffeeMaking_127e3f02_1:

    # mel "Excuse me?"
    mel "你说什么？"

# game/Days/dayNine.rpy:4558
translate chinese d9_coffeeMaking_f63122c7:

    # mc "For you to trust me. What would it take?"
    mc "让你能信任我。要怎么做才行？"

# game/Days/dayNine.rpy:4561
translate chinese d9_coffeeMaking_377e815d:

    # mel "..."
    mel "……"

# game/Days/dayNine.rpy:4562
translate chinese d9_coffeeMaking_ff450420:

    # mel "Nothing you could offer, I assure you."
    mel "我敢保证，你给不出什么。"

# game/Days/dayNine.rpy:4564
translate chinese d9_coffeeMaking_c76483a1:

    # mc "So stoic! Try me."
    mc "这么严肃？试试看。"

# game/Days/dayNine.rpy:4566
translate chinese d9_coffeeMaking_80a2992b:

    # "She turns on her chair to face you fully, giving you her undivided attention for the first time."
    "她在椅子上转过身来，正对着你，第一次把全部注意力都放在你身上。"

# game/Days/dayNine.rpy:4568
translate chinese d9_coffeeMaking_9e14efb1:

    # mel "You want to know what it would take?"
    mel "你想知道要怎样才行？"

# game/Days/dayNine.rpy:4571
translate chinese d9_coffeeMaking_ca378064:

    # mel "Stop acting like every other power-hungry man I've ever met."
    mel "别再摆出我见过的那些权欲熏心的男人那副样子。"

# game/Days/dayNine.rpy:4575
translate chinese d9_coffeeMaking_7a0a935e:

    # mel "Stop pretending that ridiculous contract is anything other than a pervert's fantasy disguised as a policy."
    mel "别再装作那份荒唐的合同不是变态幻想披了层规章的外衣。"

# game/Days/dayNine.rpy:4579
translate chinese d9_coffeeMaking_40960300:

    # mel "And stop assuming that making me coffee will somehow change my opinion of you."
    mel "也别再以为给我煮杯咖啡就能改变我对你的看法。"

# game/Days/dayNine.rpy:4581
translate chinese d9_coffeeMaking_85607171:

    # mc "So... what you're saying is, the coffee's working?"
    mc "所以……你的意思是，咖啡见效了？"

# game/Days/dayNine.rpy:4583
translate chinese d9_coffeeMaking_364f11f9:

    # "She almost smiles. {w}Almost."
    "她嘴角差点扬起来。{w}只是差点。"

# game/Days/dayNine.rpy:4585
translate chinese d9_coffeeMaking_b338eacc:

    # mel "You're insufferable."
    mel "你真让人受不了。"

# game/Days/dayNine.rpy:4587
translate chinese d9_coffeeMaking_91d432aa:

    # mc "Well, that's not very nice."
    mc "哎呀，这话可不好听。"

# game/Days/dayNine.rpy:4588
translate chinese d9_coffeeMaking_ea423278:

    # mc "I'm just trying to understand."
    mc "我只是想弄明白。"

# game/Days/dayNine.rpy:4591
translate chinese d9_coffeeMaking_517ab97a:

    # "She picks up the cup you made her and takes a small sip."
    "她端起你给她做的那杯，轻轻抿了一口。"

# game/Days/dayNine.rpy:4596
translate chinese d9_coffeeMaking_b5007c85:

    # mel "...It's acceptable."
    mel "……还行。"

# game/Days/dayNine.rpy:4598
translate chinese d9_coffeeMaking_e33d32f3:

    # mc "High praise."
    mc "这评价可真高。"

# game/Days/dayNine.rpy:4600
translate chinese d9_coffeeMaking_f4c9d014:

    # mel "Missing the sugar."
    mel "糖放少了。"

# game/Days/dayNine.rpy:4602
translate chinese d9_coffeeMaking_a2ee910b:

    # mc "Ah, I didn't know how you liked it."
    mc "啊，我不知道你爱喝什么口味。"

# game/Days/dayNine.rpy:4603
translate chinese d9_coffeeMaking_5e2a481a:

    # mc "See? Talking helps. If I'd known, I could've made it perfect the first time."
    mc "看吧？多沟通就有用。早知道的话，第一杯就能做到完美。"

# game/Days/dayNine.rpy:4604
translate chinese d9_coffeeMaking_375ab52e:

    # mc "How many sugars?"
    mc "要加几块糖？"

# game/Days/dayNine.rpy:4607
translate chinese d9_coffeeMaking_b436a831:

    # mel "That's none of your concern."
    mel "不关你的事。"

# game/Days/dayNine.rpy:4609
translate chinese d9_coffeeMaking_610effe3:

    # mc "I literally just made you inadequate coffee. I think it's relevant."
    mc "我刚刚可是亲手给你泡了杯不合格的咖啡。我觉得这事我有权过问。"

# game/Days/dayNine.rpy:4611
translate chinese d9_coffeeMaking_df803b8d:

    # mel "I don't want you making me coffee again."
    mel "我不想再让你给我泡咖啡了。"

# game/Days/dayNine.rpy:4613
translate chinese d9_coffeeMaking_0f0f78d6:

    # mc "So you're just going to drink bitter coffee out of spite?"
    mc "所以你就打算赌气喝苦咖啡？"

# game/Days/dayNine.rpy:4615
translate chinese d9_coffeeMaking_1b141d38:

    # mel "If it means you stop trying to... whatever this is."
    mel "只要能让你别再来……这套把戏。"

# game/Days/dayNine.rpy:4617
translate chinese d9_coffeeMaking_a2562774:

    # mc "I'm not trying anything. Just having a conversation. Trying to mend a bridge I didn't even know was broken."
    mc "我什么也没图。就是想聊聊天。想补一座我甚至不知道断了的桥。"

# game/Days/dayNine.rpy:4619
translate chinese d9_coffeeMaking_d27c3362:

    # mel "I don't want to have a conversation with you."
    mel "我不想和你聊天。"

# game/Days/dayNine.rpy:4621
translate chinese d9_coffeeMaking_5b3b7da2:

    # mc "And yet, here we are."
    mc "可我们现在不就在聊吗。"

# game/Days/dayNine.rpy:4623
translate chinese d9_coffeeMaking_02455599:

    # mel "Because you insisted on sitting here?"
    mel "还不是因为你偏要坐在这儿？"

# game/Days/dayNine.rpy:4626
translate chinese d9_coffeeMaking_f7b3997a:

    # mc "I could move. There are as you say {i}six{/i} other tables in this room."
    mc "我可以走。这屋子里正如你所说，还有{i}六{/i}张桌子。"

# game/Days/dayNine.rpy:4628
translate chinese d9_coffeeMaking_9e07221a:

    # mel "Please do."
    mel "请便。"

# game/Days/dayNine.rpy:4632
translate chinese d9_coffeeMaking_37ea2225:

    # mc "After we talk. We're going to be working together, I'd like to least be amicable, please?"
    mc "等我们谈完再走。以后要一起工作，至少我想和你和睦相处，行吗？"

# game/Days/dayNine.rpy:4636
translate chinese d9_coffeeMaking_6d4c7b8d:

    # "She sets the cup down sharply with a deep sigh escaping her lips."
    "她把杯子重重放下，唇间逸出一声长长的叹息。"

# game/Days/dayNine.rpy:4639
translate chinese d9_coffeeMaking_42c82f5d:

    # mel "Three."
    mel "三。"

# game/Days/dayNine.rpy:4643
translate chinese d9_coffeeMaking_7111f63b:

    # mcT "Little by little..."
    mcT "一点点来……"

# game/Days/dayNine.rpy:4644
translate chinese d9_coffeeMaking_ddbccb91:

    # mc "Three. Got it. Thank you."
    mc "三，收到。谢谢。"

